WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The Membrane. Operator approval flow. Recorded against the real gate and dashboard. Demo data is simulated.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.300
A call requires operator approval. The gate holds it. Nothing runs.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:40.100
The operator reviews the exact held request and approves it once.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:54.600
The caller retries. One approval, one dispatch, receipted, under the same signed scope. The next identical call holds again.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:03.800
A second call asks to merge a pull request.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:27.700
The operator rejects it. Rejected calls never run.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:37.400
The retried merge holds again. Nothing executed.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:43.067
Every hold, decision and execution is receipted. themembrane.org
